<title>MEXICO: Desc 1996 net profit climbs.</title>
<headline>Desc 1996 net profit climbs.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican conglomerate Desc SA on Thursday reported 1996 net profits of 1.897 billion pesos versus profits of 329 million pesos the previous year.</p>
<p>The company's earnings per share was 6.62 pesos versus 1.19 pesos in 1995. A Reuters' survey of four industry analysts predicted an average profit per share of of 6.10 pesos.</p>
